            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## macOS

- Mention another agent to send a task or share a previous reply. Review the exact message inline and choose when a reply should start a new turn.
- Queued follow-ups reach a live turn when the harness can accept them. Shared sandbox turns wait for confirmed cleanup.
- The Computer toolbar groups Chrome Password Manager and 1Password in one Passwords menu.
- The sidebar has a Discord community button, and the production app has a refined indigo icon.

This update also patches bundled runtime dependencies and tightens handoff privacy.
]]></description>
